    <section class="references" id="sect-00012">
    <title>References</title>
    <para id="para-00033">Ajrouch, K. J., Hu, R. X., Webster, N. J., &amp; Antonucci, T. C. (2024). Friendship trajectories and health across the lifespan. <emphasis effect="italics">Developmental Psychology</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">60</emphasis>(1), 94–107. https://doi.org/10.1037/dev0001589</para>
